label Greeting
if {Transaction_Chapter} == 0.0:
	# Chapter 1 — "The Inherited Burden" (DEBUT)
	ReynaMayari: The blood of the old owner runs in your veins, I see. 
	ReynaMayari: I am Mayari, Queen of the silver spires of Biringan. And you, little mortal, are holding a ledger heavy with unpaid debts.
	ReynaMayari: Your grandmother’s time ended before our tally was settled. In my city, an unbalanced ledger is an affront to order. 
	ReynaMayari: I am here to reclaim that which belongs to the silver spires.
	ReynaMayari: The tally for this cycle stands at {Global_TodayQuota} pesos. 
	ReynaMayari: Do not look away, mortal. Let us see if the balance has been met... 
	[signal arg="deduct_quota"]
	[end_timeline]

elif {Transaction_Chapter} == 1.0:
	# Chapter 2 — "The Weight of the Quota"
	ReynaMayari: You look exhausted, little mortal. The burden of this ledger is heavy by design.
	ReynaMayari: Do not think this is mere misfortune. I set these quotas myself. 
	ReynaMayari: Biringan does not suffer weakness in its partners. Hand over tonight's share.
	[signal arg="deduct_quota"]
	[end_timeline]

elif {Transaction_Chapter} == 2.0:
	# Chapter 3 — "The Black Rice"
	ReynaMayari: You withstand the storm far better than I anticipated. Your resilience is... peculiar.
	ReynaMayari: Let us see if your pockets are as resilient as your spirit tonight.
	[signal arg="deduct_quota"]
	[end_timeline]

elif {Transaction_Chapter} == 3.0:
	# Chapter 4 — "The True Debt"
	ReynaMayari: You labor over counting coins, yet you do not even know what you are paying for.
	ReynaMayari: Your grandmother did not borrow money from Biringan. She bargained for protection. 
	ReynaMayari: As long as she paid tribute, the darker entities of the forest would not touch this town. 
	ReynaMayari: You are holding back the tide with every coin you surrender.
	[signal arg="deduct_quota"]
	[end_timeline]

elif {Transaction_Chapter} == 4.0:
	# Chapter 5 — "The Cold Metropolis"
	ReynaMayari: My city is flawless. The spires of Biringan are carved from solid moonlight. Dust does not settle, and nothing ever decays.
	ReynaMayari: It is also utterly silent. 
	ReynaMayari: Perhaps that is why I find this dusty box of yours... tolerable. Provide the tally.
	[signal arg="deduct_quota"]
	[end_timeline]

elif {Transaction_Chapter} == 5.0:
	# Chapter 6 — "The Queen's Check-in"
	ReynaMayari: I observed the giant man... Kap, you call him. And the loud, one-eyed child. 
	ReynaMayari: You are weaving a strange magic from this tiny wooden box. 
	ReynaMayari: It is time for the box to yield its fruit to the Queen.
	[signal arg="deduct_quota"]
	[end_timeline]

elif {Transaction_Chapter} == 6.0:
	# Chapter 7 — "The Diminishing Ledger"
	ReynaMayari: The tally is thin. Soon, the numbers will align, and the ledger will close.
	ReynaMayari: It has been centuries since a mortal honored a pact with such... stubborn dedication. 
	ReynaMayari: Let us proceed with tonight's tally.
	[signal arg="deduct_quota"]
	[end_timeline]

elif {Transaction_Chapter} == 7.0:
	# Chapter 8 — "The Ledger Closes"
	ReynaMayari: It is done.
	ReynaMayari: The debt of your bloodline is erased. As Queen of Biringan, I declare the pact renewed. 
	ReynaMayari: Karimlan falls under my eternal shadow once more. Whatever walks in the dark shall not cross your threshold.
	ReynaMayari: Keep your coins tonight. You have earned your grandmother's peace.
	[signal arg="story_success"]
	[end_timeline]

elif {Transaction_Chapter} == 8.0:
	# Chapter 9 — "The Patron of the Moon"
	ReynaMayari: I require nothing from your ledger tonight. I am merely... passing through.
	ReynaMayari: Keep the coin I leave upon your counter. Tadhana works in mysterious ways, child. 
	ReynaMayari: The moonlight will always guide the lost to your store.
	[signal arg="unlock_collectible" value="SilverPesoOfBiringan"]
	[signal arg="story_success"]
	[end_timeline]

label SuccessFirst
ReynaMayari: [pause=0.4] It seems your lineage still holds some value.
ReynaMayari: The installment has been meticulously tallied and collected. 
ReynaMayari: If you maintain this dedication, the shadow shall eventually fade.
[signal arg="story_success"]
[end_timeline]

label Success
if {Transaction_SatisfyVar} <= 33:
	ReynaMayari: [pause=0.4] The balance is restored for now. The numbers align with the ancient agreements.
elif {Transaction_SatisfyVar} <= 66:
	ReynaMayari: [pause=0.4] A meager offering, perhaps, but it is sufficient to keep the ledgers quiet.
else:
	ReynaMayari: [pause=0.4] You labor with a stubborn persistence that is... unexpected. The collection is complete.
[signal arg="story_success"]
[end_timeline]

label Angry
if {Transaction_WrongItemVar} <= 50:
	ReynaMayari: [wave blue]I am deeply disappointed.[/wave] [pause=0.5]
	ReynaMayari: Your industry has failed. This shallow drawer contains nothing but a plea for mercy.
else:
	ReynaMayari: [wave blue]This tally is an affront to Biringan.[/wave] [pause=0.5]
	ReynaMayari: Do not mistake my presence for a visitation of charity.
[signal arg="story_success"]
[end_timeline]

label Talk
ReynaMayari: Speak only if it brings balance to the moment. 
ReynaMayari: I require {Transaction_ItemWants}.
ReynaMayari: Get to it.
[end_timeline]

label Satisfy
ReynaMayari: The Moon acknowledges your effort.
[end_timeline]

label WrongItem
ReynaMayari: This is an error of perception. It is not what was sought.
[end_timeline]

